      "text": "those who persecute violently will be smitten, D&C 24:16. whosoever shall go to law against the Lord’s servants shall be cursed by law, D&C 24:17. fear of persecution caused James Covel to reject word, D&C 40:2. Jews shall lament because they persecuted their king, D&C 45:53. great church persecutes Saints of God, D&C 88:94. persecution of Saints in Missouri, D&C 98: Intro. (101: Intro.). elders will be rewarded if they bear persecutions patiently, D&C 98:23–27. proclaim gospel in midst of persecution, D&C 99:1. brethren have been afflicted and persecuted because of transgressions, D&C 101:1–2. they who endure persecution shall partake of glory, D&C 101:35. he who exercises compulsion will be left unto himself to persecute Saints, D&C 121:38. persecution gives experience, D&C 122:7. history of persecution of Church to be kept, D&C 123. they persecuted prophets before you, D&C 127:4.",
